  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I've noticed that VR users can still use their keyboards to move whilst still wearing the headset, but are unable to do gesture overrides (such as Shift F1 - F8) on the keyboard. There are still a lot of use that are DK1 and DK2 users that would really enjoy support for us. I am currently a DK2 user and use either keyboard or an Xbox One controller to play in VRC. It would really be a weight off my shoulders and other DK users if this was a feature. Thanks",
